### Variables de Entorno
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### 1. Autenticación como Admin de Clínica
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jhoel.admin.clinica@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Captura del Token
@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.access_token}}

### 3. Listar Documentos del Tenant
# @name listDocs
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Ver Detalle de un Documento
# Toma automáticamente el ID del primer documento del listado anterior
@firstDocId = {{listDocs.response.body.data.data[0].id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{firstDocId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Historial de Versiones del Documento
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{firstDocId}}/versions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json